  "content": "Paragraphe. The meaning of mathematics is very hard to get across without these named block environments, which carefully offset important formal statements from the rest of the text. Lemmas, Theorems, and Proofs are not aesthetics, *they* are specific structural features of a text, just as important to mathematics as code blocks are to discussing programming. This is why I think these blocks should be supported by multimarkdown.",
